                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I just wanted to leave a quick review for each of this developers games after playing thru all of them over the course of the last 2 weeks. This was their first game, you can tell as it is the least polished and most simple game. That being said, it is a fairly decent combat platformer. Cool vibe, good controls, a bit repetitive, but overall I did enjoy this game. Was able to complete all the levels over 2 hours on my Steam Deck without any technical issues. Check out his other games: Ghoul Boy and Beholgar 1 and 2.",
